{#- "Back to top" button, fixed at the bottom right, on pages with `toTop: true` (the longer ones). It
    appears once the top of the page has scrolled out of view and returns to the top (script in
    layouts/base.njk). Without JavaScript it is always shown and simply jumps to the start of the content. -#}
<a class="to-top" href="#main" data-to-top>
  {% include "partials/arrow.njk" %}
  <span class="visually-hidden">Back to top</span>
</a>
